### Remaining Concerns
Two judgment calls I left alone: the section titled "What Happens When penguinz0 Actually Gets Bothered" ends on the T-Pain retirement joke, which reads as a trailing shrug rather than a landed close (though the shrug arguably *is* the character), and the chess section jumps back to 2020 with no time signal after 2024–25 material. Both are defensible as-is; flagging in case you want them tightened in a later pass.
